  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">Western Digital Corporation</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentLargestHoldingCompany>
